  43:../Src/main.c **** /* Debug instrumentation -----------------------------------------------------*/
  44:../Src/main.c **** /* Bit-bang timing.
  45:../Src/main.c ****    LCD_BIT_DELAY_LOOPS is applied on EVERY SPI bit, so raising it slows the whole
  46:../Src/main.c ****    transfer down (both during init and during the pixel fill). LCD_DEBUG_SLOW_SPI
  47:../Src/main.c ****    adds an extra, much larger delay while the short init command stream is being
  48:../Src/main.c ****    sent, so a scope can capture it. */
